msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"This aisle gets hit pretty often, what with all the\r\n"
"magazines, makeup, and other expensive items."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Really? Even though it's out in the open like this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Well, at this angle, it's hard to see from the registers.\r\n"
"Plus, makeup is so small that it's easy to steal no matter\r\n"
"where it is. Guess it's popular to sell to friends and such."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"People really do that? Sheesh, what is this world coming\r\n"
"to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Anyway. I need you to keep watch right here, and if you see\r\n"
"anyone suspicious, confront them before they leave the\r\n"
"store. Think you can do that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Yeah. If I see somebody trying to pull something, I'll get\r\n"
"all up in their face, no problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "That's what I'm talkin' about!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"There's a lot of shoplifting at around this time of day, so\r\n"
"I'm sure you'll find someone if you watch closely enough.\r\n"
"Now go get these bastards!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "All right. I'll see what I can do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "I'll let you know when the time's up. Good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "(Okay. So there are three customers in here...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "(A young girl looking at makeup...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "(A young guy looking at manga...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "(And a businessman looking at bento boxes.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "(One of these people could very well be a shoplifter.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Convenience stores do sell pretty decent makeup after all...\r\n"
"How wonderful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "(She's on her way out. What should I do?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid ""
"Hold it right there, missy. I don't believe you paid for\r\n"
"that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"What, you think I look like a shoplifter or something? I bet\r\n"
"you just want to feel me up, you disgusting creep!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "I'd rather feel up the merchandise you took. Now let's see it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "So? Did you find whatever I \"shoplifted\"?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"No... It looks like I made a mistake. I'm very sorry to have\r\n"
"bothered you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Get a life, ya perv! Geez..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "(Guess I blew that one.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "(She doesn't quite fit the image of a shoplifter.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "Sweet. They got the new issue I've been lookin' for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "(He's on his way out. What should I do?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid ""
"Hold it right there, buster. I don't believe you paid for\r\n"
"that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "Empty out your pockets. Let's see what you got."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid "...Oh shit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Aha, what's this? I haven't seen you pay for that yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "I, um, was just about to take it to the register! Yeah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid ""
"Tell me about it in the office. Or you could tell that to\r\n"
"the police, if you prefer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "Well, I just... I, uh... Fuck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid ""
"Bingo! Looks like we caught him red-handed. Say, would you\r\n"
"mind keeping watch a little longer? You know, in case anyone\r\n"
"else manages to slip through the cracks while I'm occupied."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "(All right. I'll stay at my post for a little longer.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "(No, he doesn't exactly seem like the shoplifting type.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "I'm so sick of these bento lunches..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid "(He's on his way out. What should I do?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid ""
"Hold it right there, mister. I don't believe you paid for\r\n"
"that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid "Excuse me!? I don't have anything on me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid "You wouldn't be trying to shoplift anything, would you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid ""
"What a rude accusation! I've been buying lunches here for a\r\n"
"while now, but maybe I'll take my business elsewhere!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid "Fine. But before that, cough up what you took. All of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid "There. Are you satisfied?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid ""
"No... It looks like I made a mistake. I'm very sorry to have\r\n"
"bothered you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid ""
"I might not make much, but at least I'm not a thief! How\r\n"
"about treating me with some respect!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid "(Guess I blew that one.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "(No, I doubt he'd be one to shoplift anything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid "I really appreciate all the help you've given me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid ""
"I can't believe you found a criminal in such a short time!\r\n"
"You've been a tremendous help!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid "...Guess I have a knack for finding people like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1468"
msgid ""
"Here's your day's pay. Just a little something for your\r\n"
"trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1480"
msgid "You got <Color:8>3,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1492"
msgid ""
"Thanks again! I hope you'll help us again in the future if\r\n"
"something else comes up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1516"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1528"
msgid ""
"I can't believe you found a criminal in such a short time!\r\n"
"You've been a great help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1540"
msgid "...Guess I have a knack for finding people like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1552"
msgid ""
"But you also accused someone else of shoplifting even though\r\n"
"they didn't take anything at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1564"
msgid ""
"I'd rather not make our honest, paying customers feel\r\n"
"uncomfortable, you know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1576"
msgid "Sorry about that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1588"
msgid "In any case... Here's your day's pay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1600"
msgid "You got <Color:8>1,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1612"
msgid "Thanks again for your help. Hope to see you around soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1636"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1648"
msgid "No shoplifters, huh? That doesn't sound right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1660"
msgid "Hold on while I go check the security camera."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1720"
msgid ""
"Right there! The guy reading magazines! He stole himself\r\n"
"a goddamn manga, for crying out loud!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1732"
msgid "Sorry. Guess I missed him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1744"
msgid "*sigh* When is this craziness gonna end..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1756"
msgid "Wish I could've been more of a help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1768"
msgid ""
"Oh, don't worry about it. I appreciate your efforts all the\r\n"
"same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1792"
msgid "You got 1,500 EXP."
msgstr ""

